 "sentences": [
  "Neville Chamberlain isn't just a wartime leader.",
  "He was Prime Minister from May 1937 until May 1940.",
  "He is famous for his foreign policy of appeasement.",
  "In 1938, he signed the Munich Agreement, ceding the Sudetenland to Nazi Germany.",
  "After Hitler invaded Poland in 1939, Chamberlain declared war.",
  "Before politics, he actually worked in business and local government.",
  "He only entered Parliament at age 49."
